 "title": "Strikepoint",
 "genre": "Shooter",
 "subgenre": "FPS",
 "tier": "AA",
 "tagline": "A tactical first-person shooter: three-mission campaign, team skirmish, ten-wave holdout and a solo battle royale with building.",
 "description": "Fight Black Tide across a rain-slick night dockyard, a sun-bleached hillside village and an industrial plant at dusk. Gunfeel first: aim down real sights, learnable recoil patterns, spread bloom, tactical and empty reloads, shells, tracers and surface impacts. Enemies take cover, peek, flank, suppress you and throw telegraphed grenades while calling out to each other. Modes: Campaign (breach, defend, plant, extract and a gunship finale), Skirmish team deathmatch vs bots, Holdout wave survival with buy stations, and Dropzone — drop onto Harrow Isle, loot tiered weapons, outrun the storm and quick-build cover from salvaged alloy.",
 "playTime": "30–60 min",
 "controls": "Mouse + keyboard (remappable), gamepad, or touch twin-sticks. WASD move · mouse look · LMB fire · RMB aim · Shift sprint · C crouch/slide · Space jump/mantle · R reload · G frag · T smoke · F interact · V melee · Q/E lean · B build (Dropzone) · Esc pause.",
